### 1. 登录获取 session（必须先登录，后续请求会共享 cookie）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.log("登录成功，session 自动维护");
%}

### 2. 查询所有文档（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/document/list

### 3. 模糊搜索文档（GET，关键词：Spring）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/document/search?keyword=Spring

### 4. 添加文档（POST）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/document/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "MyBatis 教程",
  "type": "技术文档",
  "author": "赵六",
  "content": "MyBatis 是持久层框架...",
  "fileSize": 2048
}

### 5. 修改文档
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/document/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "title": "MyBatis 深入浅出",
  "type": "技术文档",
  "author": "赵六",
  "content": "修改后的内容...",
  "fileSize": 2560
}

### 6. 软删除单个文档（DELETE，移到回收站）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/document/delete/4

### 7. 批量软删除（DELETE，假设删除 id=2 和 3）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/document/deleteBatch
Content-Type: application/json

[2, 3]

### 8. 查看回收站列表（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/list

### 9. 搜索回收站（GET）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/search?keyword=年度

### 10. 恢复单个文档（PUT）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/restore/4

### 11. 批量恢复（PUT）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/restoreBatch
Content-Type: application/json

[2, 3]

### 12. 永久删除单个文档（DELETE）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/permanent/4

### 13. 批量永久删除（DELETE）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/document/recycle/permanentBatch
Content-Type: application/json

[2, 3]